# The grammar has significant whitespace and the corpus tests compare exact
# input, so every text file here must be LF on all platforms (a CRLF checkout
# under core.autocrlf=true makes `tree-sitter test` fail). Generated files are
# also byte-compared against a fresh `tree-sitter generate` by `npm run check`.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.wasm binary

src/parser.c linguist-generated
src/grammar.json linguist-generated
src/node-types.json linguist-generated
src/tree_sitter/** linguist-generated
bindings/** linguist-generated
